      "content": "wait really? i mean it doesn't even hurt that much, it's just a discomfort. i had some really spicy food for lunch right before it happened and it felt exactly like when i get heartburn. i don't have time to go to the doctor for something that probably just needs an antacid. are you sure it's not just indigestion? can i just try a higher dose of Tums to see if it goes away?",
